> Recorded outcomes and limits

Held-out answer accuracy is 22/32 (0.6875), with cross-entropy 0.6843. Four-way uniform chance is .25; a deterministic lookup of the uniquely matching fact is an exact synthetic oracle. The remaining answer errors under the three-epoch budget are shown below. This small generated pool does not establish document-reading performance.

All three validation epochs are shown. The test observations do not select an additional checkpoint.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/key_value_history.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
